      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "You can already change where the cache is, and how big it is, see https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/configuration-file\n\nMake sure you also modify cache_expiry_delay to something like 999 so it doesn't delete old stuff just because of age.",
